WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:03.051
(energetic tropical music)

00:00:03.051 --> 00:00:06.520
- Plants are the foundation for all life.

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:09.059
Understanding plant diversity is critical

00:00:09.059 --> 00:00:11.226
to our continued survival.

00:00:14.067 --> 00:00:17.248
The goal of the World Flora
Online is to accumulate

00:00:17.248 --> 00:00:21.496
in one place, on a website, a
description and illustrations

00:00:21.496 --> 00:00:23.913
of every known plant species.

00:00:25.408 --> 00:00:27.877
We are about five years into the process.

00:00:27.877 --> 00:00:29.709
We are accumulating new specimens.

00:00:29.709 --> 00:00:32.805
We're digitizing them, and
all of that information feeds

00:00:32.805 --> 00:00:36.269
in ultimately to the World Flora Online.

00:00:36.269 --> 00:00:39.269
(suspenseful music)

00:00:40.109 --> 00:00:42.349
The main way that our specimens come to us

00:00:42.349 --> 00:00:45.728
is that they are collected in the field.

00:00:45.728 --> 00:00:49.895
When they're here, they are
mounted onto stiff paper.

00:00:52.416 --> 00:00:55.087
The information about
the plant is transcribed

00:00:55.087 --> 00:00:59.549
onto a little label that
goes along with the specimen.

00:00:59.549 --> 00:01:03.632
A good mounter can do
about 50 specimens per day.

00:01:04.696 --> 00:01:08.920
Once the specimens are
mounted, we photograph them.

00:01:08.920 --> 00:01:13.087
Then, that information goes
online pretty much immediately.

00:01:17.502 --> 00:01:20.326
The project began in 2010,

00:01:20.326 --> 00:01:23.659
and it is meant to be completed by 2020.

00:01:25.698 --> 00:01:29.865
We've photographed about 2.6
million of our specimens.

00:01:30.886 --> 00:01:34.911
Worldwide, it must be on the
order of 10 or 15 million.

00:01:34.911 --> 00:01:37.928
(soft acoustic music)

00:01:37.928 --> 00:01:39.546
Plants are endlessly fascinating,

00:01:39.546 --> 00:01:42.043
and we have to know what
they are and how they differ

00:01:42.043 --> 00:01:44.554
from one another in order to understand

00:01:44.554 --> 00:01:48.721
what kind of measures need
to be taken to protect them.

